-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1106: a rule under a § heading. `l4 lts --contract` used to
-- look only at the top level and say "no top-level rule named `pay on time`",
-- where `l4 explore --contract` found the rule.

§ `Payment`

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Alice
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF pay

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
DECIDE `pay on time` IS
    PARTY Alice
    MUST  pay
    WITHIN 10
    LEST BREACH BY Alice BECAUSE "late"
